@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+dobe-texture: private headless Dobe Texture engine
+
+Customer entry: dobe mcp or dobe CLI. This binary is an internal component.
+
+  dobe-texture --version
+  dobe-texture info <project.tcraft | mesh | builtin:id>
+  dobe-texture commands [--filter <text>]
+  dobe-texture run <input> <command-id> [params-json] [-o <out.tcraft>]
+  dobe-texture batch <script.json>
+  dobe-texture new <mesh | builtin:id> <out.tcraft> [--resolution <px>] [--sample]
+  dobe-texture bake <input> -o <out.tcraft> [--resolution <px>] [--maps <ids>]
+  dobe-texture export <input> <dir> [--preset <name>] [--format <ext>] [--size <px>]
+  dobe-texture render <input> <out.png> --samples <n> --cpu [--size <WxH>]
+  dobe-texture mcp [--read-root <dir>] [--write-root <dir>]
+
+Native projects retain editable texture sets, layers, masks and resources.
+MCP file access uses the supplied workspace roots. No editor or TCP serving.
+CPU path tracing requires --samples and --cpu. CPU baking is used by this build.
+The runtime admits bounded typed operations; the native command list is not a
+customer API or a promise that every upstream operation has been qualified.
